==French==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|frm|fr}} {{m|frm|tous}} < {{etyl|fro|fr}} {{m|fro|toz}}, equivalent to {{suffix|tout|s|lang=fr|nocat=1}}.

===Pronunciation===
* The pronoun:
** {{audio|Fr-tous.ogg|audio|lang=fr}}
** {{IPA|/tus/|lang=fr}}
** {{a|Quebec}} {{IPA|/tʊs/|lang=fr}}
* The adjective:
** {{audio|Fr-tout.ogg|audio|lang=fr}}
** {{IPA|/tu/|lang=fr}}

===Pronoun===
{{fr-pron}}

# [[all]]
#: {{ux|fr|Ils étaient '''tous''' là.|They were '''all''' here.}}
# [[everybody]]
#: {{ux|fr|'''Tous''' étaient là.|'''Everybody''' was here.}}

====Related terms====
