===Adjective===
{{head|fr|adjective form}}

# {{masculine plural of|tout|lang=fr}}
#: ''Je me brosse les dents '''tous''' les jours.''
#:: I brush my teeth '''every''' day. (Lit: "I brush my teeth '''all''' the days.")

====Related terms====
* {{l|fr|tout le monde}}

